<title>CANADA: Canada grain stocks summary - Statscan.</title>
<headline>Canada grain stocks summary - Statscan.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada survey of farm and commercial grain stocks on Dec 31 in millions of tonnes, with farm stocks and total of a year earlier:</p>
<p>	  '96 FARM STOCKS  COMMERCIAL  TOTAL  '95 FARM '95 TOTAL</p>
<p>All Wheat	 19.108     5.668    24.776   14.755   19.860</p>
<p>Wheat, ex durum 15.808     4.604    20.412   11.605   15.489</p>
<p>Durum Wheat	3.300     1.064     4.364    3.150    4.371</p>
<p>Barley	     9.735     1.026    10.761    8.095    9.191</p>
<p>Canola	     2.758     0.522     3.280    3.460    4.290</p>
<p>Flax		 0.470     0.130     0.600    0.565    0.735</p>
<p>Oats		 2.385     0.217     2.602    1.610    1.896</p>
<p>Rye		  0.085     0.040     0.125    0.111    0.192</p>
<p>Corn for grain   4.015	n/a	 n/a     3.725     n/a</p>
<p>Soybeans	   0.610	n/a	 n/a     0.685     n/a</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
